  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Fond f&#xF6;r alfabetisering, FONAENF</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Literacy-fund, FONAENF</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sverige har givit st&#xF6;d till alfabetisering i Burkina Faso genom organisationen FONAENF under perioden 2002-2008. FONAENF( Fond pour l&#xB4;Alphabetisation et l&#xB4;Education Non Formelle) har utvecklats till det huvudsakliga instrumentet f&#xF6;r alfabetisering i Burkina Faso. L&#xE4;skunnigheten var 2009 endast 28 procent och m&#xE5;let &#xE4;r att uppn&#xE5; 60 procent &#xE5;r 2015. FONAENF har l&#xE5;ngvarig erfarenhet och en bepr&#xF6;vad org</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sweden has supported FONAENF since 2002. It is an experienced organisation handling most of the support from donors and the government to alphabetisation. Sida has found the reporting and audit for 2009 acceptable. It is proposed to support the implementation of FONAENF&#xB4;s strategic plan for 2010-11 with 40 MSEK.</narrative>
  </description>
